From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 06:30:11 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Meridian: pick several Today tabs at once
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

⌘-click (Ctrl off macOS) and ⇧-click pick Today tabs, as in Arc; a drag
moves the group together (Today order, pinned, a folder, favorites,
another space), and the context menu on a picked tab pins them, adds them
to a folder (or a new one), moves them to a space, copies their links,
archives or closes them. Esc or a plain click lets go.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
